<a name="10STORY">
<h2>10 Story Fantasy</h2>
<p>
<i>10 Story Fantasy</i> published exactly 1 issue, under the editorialship
of Donald A. Wollheim. Aside from the fact that the issue actually contained
13 stories, the issue is best known for the first publication of 
Arthur C. Clarke's "Sentinel of Eternity", later known as "The Sentinel" - and
expanded into the book <i>2001: A Space Odyssey</i>.
